Single-host Docker Compose deployment package (T22) per deploy-design.md:
- lc-go multi-binary image (+ stdlib-only lcentry launcher/probe), lc-admin,
  lc-storefront and non-root lc-caddy Dockerfiles; all external images
  digest-pinned (check-pins.sh)
- compose.yml with profiles db/app/payments-sandbox/payments-live/meta/ops,
  shared edge netns (loopback-only API), file secrets via *_FILE, hardened
  containers; NOT_RUN two-host override
- PostgreSQL config/pg_hba (superuser socket-only), logins.tsv +
  provision-logins.sh (verify-never-repair), backup/basebackup/restore/PITR
- host-setup, secrets-init, preflight (P01-P16), build-images, deploy
  (first/upgrade/app-rollback), pg-ops, watchdog (W1-W9), diagnostics,
  smoke (static S01-S06 PASS; full BLOCKED at S07 until cmd/migrate exists)
- Chinese runbooks: deploy, backup-restore, incident

No production deploy performed. cmd/migrate and other items outside
deploy/** are listed as REQUIRES_INTEGRATOR.

