+# File: deploy/env/media-worker.env.example
+# Purpose: REFERENCE ONLY. NOT DEPLOYED. MOCK only (internal/integrations/livekit/worker_env.go:174).
+#   Documents the cmd/media-worker startup contract so the future T08 deploy slice starts from
+#   facts. No compose service reads this file and host-setup.sh does not install it.
+#   Every LiveKit project is hard-wired to Environment "MOCK" and mock_dial_address must be a
+#   literal loopback address: there is no env path to LiveKit Cloud today (blocker B5).
+# Runs as/in: (future) lc-go /app/bin/media-worker. Supervised mode re-execs os.Executable()
+#   (cmd/media-worker/supervisor.go:231); lcentry uses execve, so /proc/self/exe is the worker.
+# Reads secrets (future, as *_FILE): DSNs for the commerce_media_worker / commerce_media_executor /
+#   commerce_media_recovery logins (deploy/postgres/logins.tsv "media" rows), the material
+#   keyring, and the projects JSON (contains LiveKit api_key/api_secret).
+# Used by: nobody (documentation). Status: NOT_RUN / not deployable.
+# Change rules: when T08 lands a real transport, turn this into a knob-only template and add
+#   the service + secrets to compose.yml with its own review.
+
+# COMMERCE_MEDIA_WORKER_ENABLED=1                  ""/0 -> exits immediately
+# COMMERCE_MEDIA_WORKER_DATABASE_URL_FILE=...      role commerce_media_worker (River river_media)
+# COMMERCE_MEDIA_EXECUTOR_DATABASE_URL_FILE=...    role commerce_media_executor
+# COMMERCE_MEDIA_WORKER_CONCURRENCY=4              1..32
+# COMMERCE_MEDIA_MATERIAL_ACTIVE_KEY_ID_FILE=...   AES-256-GCM material keyring (independent)
+# COMMERCE_MEDIA_MATERIAL_KEYS_JSON_FILE=...
+# COMMERCE_MEDIA_PROJECTS_JSON_FILE=...            1..128 {project_id, credential_version, endpoint,
+#                                                  api_key, api_secret, stream_hosts,
+#                                                  mock_dial_address, mock_ca_pem}
+# COMMERCE_MEDIA_RECOVERY_SUPERVISED=1             optional supervised mode (self re-exec)
+# COMMERCE_MEDIA_RECOVERY_DATABASE_URL_FILE=...    role commerce_media_recovery (supervisor only)
+# Never set COMMERCE_MEDIA_RECOVERY_INTERNAL_CHILD: the supervisor injects it for its child.
+# Readiness gates: live.media_plan_ready() and live.media_worker_ready() must be true.
